---
<aside class="howto small" aria-labelledby="howto-h"><h2 id="howto-h" class="label">How to read this page</h2><p>Every figure carries its date. Closes come from the daily feed; Last and P&amp;L follow delayed quotes that can lag the exchange; cash includes charges. Price-change P&amp;L is before charges. Net P&amp;L deducts the charges attached to the fills. <a href="/method/#price-basis">How to read the numbers: closes, delayed quotes and charges</a>.{swipe ? ' Swipe a table sideways on a phone to see every column.' : ''}</p></aside>
